# A letter fold, in thirds. No landmark marks a third, so the fold lines are coordinates.
origami letter
sheet square
valley through (1/3, 0) (1/3, 1) moving A    # the left third over the middle
valley through (2/3, 0) (2/3, 1) moving B    # then the right third over both
expect ok
expect faces 3
expect ply 3
